{"ID":"20240118151349-v33umjo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151349-v33umjo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151349-v33umjo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151349-a4amgyq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119172809-ut7j25n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119172807-136v3ja\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:14\u0026#125;","title":"045白蒿","type":"doc","updated":"20240126164706"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151349-a4amgyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151349-a4amgyq","updated":"20240126164549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主五脏邪气风寒湿痹，补中益气，长毛发令黑，疗心悬少食常饥，久服轻身耳目聪明不老。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172807-136v3ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172807-136v3ja"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】到处皆有，以水生蒌蒿最好，辛香而美。{西充有}"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119172808-2mvwjxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172808-2mvwjxl"}},{"ID":"20240119172808-bj3gku3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172808-bj3gku3"}},{"ID":"20240119172809-ut7j25n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119172809-ut7j25n","updated":"20240126164706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个45呢，我们叫做白蒿，这个‘蒿’字念“[hāo]”。那这个药味甘平，也是补中益气，能够长毛发，让头发变黑，这种是以水生的最好，水生的白蒿。这种药一般来说我们治病的时候很少用，但是它列在本草经里面都是很重要的。诸位可以开白蒿滋补一些头发啊！补中益气这倒都无所谓，滋补的药，平常我们健康的时候你可以多吃一些滋补的药，没事的时候炖一些滋补的药，这个可以放进去吃。甘平的味道，都不苦的哦。"}]}]}